  SSL_CK_IDEA_128_CBC_WITH_MD5            IDEA-CBC-MD5
- SSL_CK_DES_64_CBC_WITH_MD5              DES-CBC-MD5
+ SSL_CK_DES_64_CBC_WITH_MD5              Not implemented.
  SSL_CK_DES_192_EDE3_CBC_WITH_MD5        DES-CBC3-MD5
 
